desc.text:
When <color=#ffd780>Gravity Interference</color> is triggered, 4 Elemental Energy will be restored to Columbina;
Additionally, if the Lunar reaction type that accumulates the most <color=#ffd780>Gravity</color> for Columbina is Lunar-Charged, Lunar-Bloom, or Lunar-Crystallize, the Lunar Reaction DMG dealt by this instance of Gravity Interference is increased by 12.5%/2.5%/12.5% of Columbina's Max HP respectively. This effect can be triggered at most once every 15s.
All nearby party members' Lunar Reaction DMG is <color=#ffd780>elevated</color> by 1.5%.
